   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Granita Lusso</em></p>\n<p>You have found a brand new and destructive pathway for your technique. When you use <em>Granite Lusso</em>, you can choose a number of creatures in range up to your Cursed Energy modifier, spending 1 cursed energy per creature. These creatures take additional necrotic damage equal to your Cursed Energy score. On a failed save, they are knocked prone and stunned until the end of their next turn.</p>",
